{
  "uid": "asap-cardinality",
  "title": "Cardinality: sketch vs exact vs store and query (real collector containers)",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-35m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Three approaches to the same question: how many distinct values does each attribute have?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>generator-a/b</b><br><small>sources A and B</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>branch-a/b</b><br><small>HLL per attribute key per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>merge</b><br><small>both sources&#39; HLLs per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>detector</b><br><small>distinct counts with bounds; class per key</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>prometheus-sketch</b><br><small>query: the stored counts</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-branch-a/b</b><br><small>value &rarr; count map per key per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-merge</b><br><small>adds both sources&#39; maps: every value</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-detector</b><br><small>exact distinct counts and classes</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>prometheus-exact</b><br><small>query: the stored counts</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>raw-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>otlp-forwarder-a/b</b><br><small>forwards each point immediately (no window)</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>prometheus-raw</b><br><small>stores every raw point, one sample each</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>query-job</b><br><small>PromQL distinct count per key over the last 60 s; classes</small></div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Every stage is one pinned container. Four attributes: <code>http.route</code> and <code>http.method</code> stable, <code>k8s.pod.name</code> growing 5%/min, <code>user.id</code> unique per point. Traffic grows over 30 minutes: the rate per source doubles every 5 minutes (5k to 80k points/s), and at minute 10 <code>http.route</code> explodes from 20 to 20,000 values. Each approach writes to its own Prometheus; query-job compares store and query with exact and times every approach&#39;s query.</small></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small><b>Class</b> (per key and window, from the last 10 windows; exact and sketch use the same rules on their own counts, so a different class means the sketch's error crossed a threshold): <b>identifier-like</b> when distinct / points is at least 0.9, i.e. nearly every point has a new value; else <b>growing</b> when distinct is more than 20% above the mean of the last 10 windows (needs 3); else <b>stable</b>. Not classified below 100 points.</small></p>"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Input: points per second (both sources)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-cardinality"
      },
      "description": "Points per second of the latest window, both sources together.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(sum by (method) (last_over_time(asap_points{method=~\"sketch|exact\",attribute_key=\"http.route\"}[2m]))) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "points/s",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
